    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i've been having this weird feeling in my jaw and neck for like an hour now. it's just this heavy, dull ache, not really sharp or anything. i don't have any chest pain or anything like that so i dont think its an emergency, but it's kinda annoying. could it just be like teeth grinding or maybe just some tension from my neck?",
