      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that makes sense, it has been a pretty stressful week so i've probably been clenching my jaw a lot. i was thinking about just taking some extra ibuprofen to help the ache go away, like maybe 1000mg every few hours so it works faster? also i have some leftover prescription muscle relaxants from a back injury, would it be okay to take one of those with the ibuprofen to make sure it stops?",
